{{!
    @template block_elediaai_tutor/hero_privacy

    The subline of the dashboard hero, and the way to the privacy guidelines.

    The shield used to live inside the welcome section, which tied it to a
    text field: with no welcome message it was not rendered, and because the
    header's own shield is switched off on the dashboard and the consent
    notice hides itself once somebody has consented, the guidelines were then
    unreachable altogether. A privacy notice must not depend on whether an
    administrator filled in an optional field.

    So the block always renders. With a subline the shield follows the
    sentence as a symbol -- the text beside it would repeat what the sentence
    already frames. Alone it carries its name, because a lone shield under a
    greeting says nothing to anyone who has not been told what it means.

    It is a partial because both branches of the hero need it -- with a
    greeting and without one -- and the alternative was a third copy of the
    same SVG.

    What stands here covers the opening screen only. The hero is hidden with
    the first message, so the footer carries a second shield for the length of
    the conversation (see the quiet corner in launcher.mustache). Exactly one
    of the two is ever on screen.

    Note for editors: no mustache tag may appear in this comment. A comment
    ends at the first closing pair of braces, so a tag written here would end
    it early and print the remainder onto the page.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * welcome - The subline. Optional; the shield renders either way.
}}
{{#welcome}}
    <div class="elediaai-chat-hero-sub">
        {{{welcome}}}
        <button type="button" class="elediaai-chat-privacylink"
                data-action="privacy" aria-haspopup="dialog"
                aria-label="{{#str}}privacyguidelines, block_elediaai_tutor{{/str}}"
                title="{{#str}}privacyguidelines, block_elediaai_tutor{{/str}}">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="lucide"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"/></svg>
        </button>
    </div>
{{/welcome}}
{{^welcome}}
    <div class="elediaai-chat-hero-sub elediaai-chat-hero-sub--bare">
        <button type="button" class="elediaai-chat-privacylink elediaai-chat-privacylink--named"
                data-action="privacy" aria-haspopup="dialog">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="lucide"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"/></svg>
            <span>{{#str}}privacyguidelines, block_elediaai_tutor{{/str}}</span>
        </button>
    </div>
{{/welcome}}
